# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). Quest ids, givers, places, levels, prerequisites,
# drops and rewards from Polestar's Forever data (data-v2026.11.1: QuestieDB Forever, the 1.60.1
# client, and Polestar's corrections, whose Gnomeregan XP comes from players' Forever caches) and
# its Dungeons codex (boss order: Grubbis, Viscous Fallout, Electrocutioner 6000, Crowd Pummeler
# 9-60, Mekgineer Thermaplugg); prerequisites cross-checked with the TrinityCore Forever world base
# (2026-10-14). Wowhead Forever could not be read on 12/11/2026 (robot check): the rooms and the
# places inside are the original game's, marked "to check in game". Not played in game yet.
#
# Optional chapter: asked once at Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind, at the start of Group 9
# (`when group 2928`, 11-mille-pointes); every later step needs `when done gno-start`. Skipped:
# the whole chapter is left out and Dalaran follows.
#
# Prerequisites (Polestar's compiled guide, TrinityCore base): Gnogaine (2926) after The Day After
# (2927), taken here first; Save Techbot's Brain (2922), Essential Artificials (2924) and Data
# Rescue (2930) have only errands before them (Brother Sarno 2923, Mathiel 2925, Gaxim 2931),
# which the compiler drops and this chapter does not need. Return of the Ring (2947) after
# Grime-Encrusted Ring (2945), a drop.
# Left out: The Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962, after Gnogaine: a second trip inside with a
# fallout that decays fast), the Sparklematic 5200 boxes (2951 and its variants: three silver per
# Grime-Encrusted Object, a random box, no XP for most), Gnome Improvement (2948, after Return of
# the Ring: a Silver Bar and a Moss Agate).
#
# Flow: Ironforge (Tinker Town) -> Kharanos (Ozzie) -> the Gnomeregan outskirts (Gnogaine,
# Techbot) -> the dungeon -> Kharanos (Ozzie) -> Ironforge rewards -> Stormwind (Shoni), where
# Group 11 (Dalaran) starts. A Fine Mess (2904) is handed in at Booty Bay in Group 15.
guide groupe-alliance/10b-gnomeregan
title Group 10b · Gnomeregan (dungeon 29-33, optional)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 30-33
zone Ironforge
next groupe-alliance/12-dalaran

step Ironforge: Gnomeregan quests
  label gno-start
  when group 2928
  when level<36
  zone Ironforge
  tip Gnomeregan: a 5-player dungeon under Dun Morogh, best at 29 to 33; Mekgineer Thermaplugg, the last boss, is 34. Every quest giver stands in Tinker Town. From the Wetlands: fly from Menethil Harbor to Ironforge. Alone? Skip it: the guide goes on to Dalaran.
  note Keep 8 free quest log slots. Every player takes the quests from the givers; sharing works too.
  accept 2929                                 -- High Tinker Mekkatorque
  accept 2930                                 -- Master Mechanic Castpipe
  accept 2922                                 -- Tinkmaster Overspark
  accept 2927                                 -- Gnoarn: for Ozzie Togglevolt in Kharanos
  accept 2924 optional                        -- Klockmort Spannerspan: not offered without Mathiel's errand from Darnassus? Carry on without it

step Kharanos: Ozzie Togglevolt
  when done gno-start
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Ride out of Ironforge down to Kharanos. Ozzie hands you an empty lead phial for the fallout.
  turnin 2927                                 -- Ozzie Togglevolt
  accept 2926

step The Gnomeregan outskirts
  when done gno-start
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip West of Kharanos, before the dungeon's door. Irradiated Invaders (elite 24) roam the outskirts: target one and use the Empty Leaden Collection Phial from your bags to fill it.
  note White Punch Cards, for Data Rescue, drop from the Irradiated Invaders too (about 1 in 10): keep one.
  collect 9284 quest 2926 @19.5,37.8          -- Full Leaden Collection Phial: use the empty phial on an Irradiated Invader

step Gnomeregan: before going in
  when done gno-start
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Group of 5 at 29 to 33. Everything inside is elite and the mechanical foes hit hard.
  note In the quest log before going in: The Grand Betrayal, Data Rescue and Save Techbot's Brain! (Tinker Town). If you took them: Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators (Shoni the Shilent, Stormwind, Group 9) and Essential Artificials (Klockmort Spannerspan, Tinker Town). Bring a White Punch Card if you have one, and 3 silver per Grime-Encrusted Object you want to put in the Sparklematic 5200.
  goto 24.3,39.8 "Gnomeregan" r 25

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: everything collected in the dungeon sits in one along step (it never
# holds the route), up to Thermaplugg; Techbot too, since the sources disagree on his place
# (Polestar's data: the outskirts, Dun Morogh 19.78,31.93; the original game: inside).
step Gnomeregan: along the way
  when done gno-start
  along until gno-thermaplugg
  tip Collected all through the dungeon. Robo-mechanical Guts: the Caverndeep troggs, the Irradiated Invaders and the Dark Iron Agents, about 4 kills in 5. White Punch Card: the Caverndeep troggs and the Addled Lepers, about 1 kill in 10. Essential Artificials: from the Artificial Extrapolators, machines on the floor (where: to check in game).
  tip Techbot (elite 26): Polestar's data place him in the outskirts, the original game inside, near the start (to check in game). His Memory Core drops for every player on the quest.
  tip Each Matrix Punchograph 3005 turns one card into the next: A the White card into a Yellow one, B the Yellow into a Blue one, C the Blue into a Red one, D the Red into the Prismatic Punch Card. They stand along the way, D last, near the end (places and order of the original game: to check in game).
  tip The Clean Zone, where the gnomes who stayed sheltered, holds the Sparklematic 5200: put the Grime-Encrusted Ring in it to clean it (the Sparklematic's own quests for the other grimy objects cost 3 silver each and give a random box: optional, not in the guide). Kernobee, a gnome to rescue, is inside too (where: to check in game): escort him to the Clockwerk Run exit, his reward waits at Booty Bay, on the route of Group 15.
  note Every player with the quest loots their own. Share the quests with your group: click each in the quest log, then Share.
  collect 9277 quest 2922                     -- Techbot's Memory Core: Techbot, elite 26
  collect 9316 quest 2930                     -- Prismatic Punch Card: from the Matrix Punchograph 3005-D
  collect 9309 quest 2928 optional            -- Robo-mechanical Guts: the quest log gives the count
  collect 9279 optional                       -- White Punch Card: Caverndeep troggs, Addled Lepers
  collect 9278 x12 quest 2924 optional        -- Essential Artificial: Artificial Extrapolators
  accept 2945 item 9326 optional              -- Grime-Encrusted Ring, a drop from the Dark Iron Agents: right-click it
  turnin 2945 object 142487 optional          -- The Sparklematic 5200
  accept 2947 object 142487 optional          -- Return of the Ring: for Talvash del Kissel in Ironforge
  accept 2904 optional                        -- Kernobee
  complete 2904 optional                      -- Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit

step Gnomeregan: Mekgineer Thermaplugg
  label gno-thermaplugg
  when done gno-start
  tip The Electrocutioner 6000 and the Crowd Pummeler 9-60 come before him (the codex's order). Thermaplugg (elite 34) calls bombs out of the walls: in the original game someone stops each new one by clicking the button below it while the others fight (to check in game).
  kill 7800 quest 2929                        -- Mekgineer Thermaplugg

# Groupe Alliance 0.11.0: each hand-in has its own step, for whoever holds the quest ready to
# hand in (`when complete`): nothing waits for a quest a player could not finish.
step Kharanos: Ozzie Togglevolt
  when complete 2926
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Out of Gnomeregan and east to Kharanos, on the way back to Ironforge. His next quest, The Only Cure is More Green Glow, would need another trip inside: not in the guide.
  turnin 2926                                 -- Ozzie Togglevolt

step Tinker Town: High Tinker Mekkatorque
  when complete 2929
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2929                                 -- High Tinker Mekkatorque

step Tinker Town: Master Mechanic Castpipe
  when complete 2930
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2930                                 -- Master Mechanic Castpipe

step Tinker Town: Tinkmaster Overspark
  when complete 2922
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2922                                 -- Tinkmaster Overspark

step Tinker Town: Klockmort Spannerspan
  when complete 2924
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2924                                 -- Klockmort Spannerspan

step Mystic Ward: Talvash del Kissel
  when complete 2947
  zone Ironforge
  tip Return of the Ring: Talvash del Kissel is in the Mystic Ward. His next quest, Gnome Improvement, asks for a Silver Bar and a Moss Agate: not in the guide.
  turnin 2947                                 -- Talvash del Kissel

step Stormwind: Shoni the Shilent
  when complete 2928
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind: Shoni is in the Dwarven District, by the tram. Group 11 (Dalaran) starts in Stormwind.
  turnin 2928                                 -- Shoni the Shilent
